+order per the brief: `task-21-brief.md` (task text + BINDING gate block),
+`gate/matrix-issue16-imgui-overlay.md`, `gate/rulings-2026-08-18.md` §#16,
+`gh issue view 16`. Order of authority followed: rulings > spec > matrix >
+ticket.
